  "description": "A feature-rich WinUI 3 hex-viewer control for Windows App SDK.\n      GPU-accelerated via Win2D CanvasControl. Supports large-file streaming,\n      mouse selection, context-menu copy (hex/ASCII), configurable offset\n      formats (hex/dec/oct), column grouping, full-width auto-fit, customisable\n      colours, ASCII encoding selection (IBM437, UTF-8, CP1252, …), hover\n      cross-highlight, and SelectionChanged events.",
